sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RHODS as rhods-operator
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant TO as trainer-operator<br/>metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as emptyDir<br/>/opt/manifests-work
    participant OP as kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager<br/>9443 / 8443 / 10443
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant User as User / Dashboard / SDK
    participant Pods as Training pods

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over RHODS,OP: Flow 1 - Trainer CR reconciliation
    RHODS->>API: Create Trainer default-trainer<br/>SA token, TLS 1.2+
    TO->>API: Watch Trainer, Deployments, Services,<br/>ConfigMaps, VWCs, JobSetOperator (HTTPS/WSS)
    TO->>API: Check OLM jobset-operator, JobSetOperator cluster,<br/>jobsets CRD established
    alt JobSet missing or degraded
        API-->>TO: Not ready
        TO->>API: Trainer status Degraded=True (requeue)
    else Prerequisites OK
        TO->>API: Get/create Namespace (uncached)<br/>Get ConfigMap odh-trainer-config (uncached)
        TO->>FS: Substitute RELATED_IMAGE_* in params.env,<br/>render kustomize rhoai overlay, inject TLS profile
        FS-->>TO: Rendered manifests
        TO->>API: SSA apply (field owner trainer-module-controller)<br/>CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Service, webhooks,<br/>NetworkPolicies, ServiceMonitor, 16 runtimes, ImageStreams
        API-->>OP: Operand Deployment rolled out
        TO->>API: Update status conditions + releases, GC stale resources
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over API,TO: Flow 2 - TLS profile propagation
    TO->>API: Get apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster (startup)
    TO->>API: Write tls section to kubeflow-trainer-config<br/>+ config hash on operand pod template
    API-->>TO: APIServer profile change event
    TO->>TO: Watcher cancels manager context, pod restarts, re-resolves
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over Prom,OP: Flow 3 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>TO: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS (service-ca)<br/>Bearer token
    TO->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    TO-->>Prom: Metrics
    Prom->>OP: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token (prometheus-k8s, trainer-metrics-reader)
    OP-->>Prom: Metrics
    end

    rect rgb(250, 235, 250)
    Note over User,Pods: Flow 4 - User TrainJob (operand data path)
    User->>API: Create TrainJob 6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>User bearer token
    API->>OP: Admission webhook 443 to 9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>failurePolicy Fail
    OP-->>API: Defaulted / validated
    OP->>API: Create JobSet from ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>SA kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager
    Pods->>OP: Status updates 10443/TCP HTTPS<br/>(auth not-extracted)
    end
